{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1211,
  "batch_count": 1682,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "f1c6893d60a8989361cfd9c371f56bc8ec25f81d",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cb5e329cda2be7ef0d873b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气真好……\r\n要不要来做个日光浴呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fc18bf562e519a95749d8b88a023e819c7c21a7693391701f267bf36311a293",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d977a2f3b234400be2b4bb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将贝壳放在耳畔时所听到的声音……\r\n有股让人莫名静下心的魔力对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c65068149508fd7f11d4e86b4546dd796aaf45178256fbdc39c880d8eb40044",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9218a076622a3f0e72947cf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊……枝枒间洒落的阳光真美。\r\n都让我快要睡着了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b98c204d26e18a06d8e19752675858fead2bae276f250875d47fa5f7f0e7027",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94e387d87396da8e70e15ede",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "像今天这种日子，\r\n到海边玩应该很开心吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc9defbc6a25da7f8f400984e1eb2a4573348668240ca662a6bda8232fa69381",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5debbeb526a6031540da50e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我习惯凉爽的气候了。\r\n毕竟我是在雪国长大的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2687e7dffd15ebb3c233b88fdb26b694aad6b1cc5fefc7f19e442720d67f2475",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c78360d6a0fa2fb740197508",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃……不要紧。\r\n跑一跑就暖了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9f446ed056149a77025155ad7e0a8a6a3231c36715b418ae62142076d7ca7ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc63a0faf3464b02b65612c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说缅栀花的香味\r\n似乎有助于提升集中力。\r\n……感觉很适合在比赛前使用呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d5f85c310ccb8a124ffeba343f86de32544a615695c8b05b1d28339e03265a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b47d0bc63924daaa1dbc58a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小小的珍珠真漂亮……\r\n就像白雪一样闪闪发光……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1033505fd2d1ef0936e29ed43808013b316c7a0ceae4202717d2648a95e7d4a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe701473b3f9731091acf699",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一直都在跑步哦。\n当然，接下来也是。",
      "source_fingerprint": "974f73203d526e4f031b70afb5c14dc14fc3f56c6a5c276f93cdc6ddf399420f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf2f34a154f18dbc756a2008",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くわ……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a27b65282aaa4aa8499e7a78d831aa344767394904e17e051c954f1f5d1ef9fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0f6b0d0ca1abe2b7a89c103",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天\n会在怎样的赛道上奔跑呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "18d66178d79a3e9e290622a423d219badb57f8ead35bd82fc2c01d56c55f9889",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aee1acfbb56a46083eeb37f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在奔跑这方面，我不会输给任何人。\n所以请安排严厉的训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43c1eb07a5997e4a1fda0bd2c6790a4e168146aa3c04bc19e4b33b6b998dc3c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df7df1af0efdbfde548b1862",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好舒服的风……\n跑起来的话，应该会更开心吧……\n呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40199227b1b7b1c5ae5d7888ff9770218579fb39fce616d09ad1ebb25b95cb9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1181f09af811a916bb14e08b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有种实力在逐渐增强的感觉。\n……不好好珍惜这种感觉的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c588a1b1d981fde3b761ded77ce351214a2717119a7340b4d1bd744230cf029",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:579898eced541f28334cfc02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "继续这样成长下去的话，\n就感觉不管怎样的景色都能看见呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "40b4ce40e9818e2a9320a6c8b7cc67f3a8b720e528e38dbb12722384779da274",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1c7dc42f840554349de8c65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便是因为一些微小的契机，\n双眼所见的景色也会变化……\n有种被这样教导了的感觉呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dac5c36c6a07abdf94412e4835053ecded1469f8dbe70e3ec7b1a62ee253137b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb2a2541056df68c2c95282f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备已经完成了哦。\n要现在开始吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f468b5f7f560d61bd8eddcb1a573a3b56377dd22fb453ca40029cf071a4a9764",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9366e75a2790747ac4d9a09d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要跑到哪里呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fe868e9b2029b2a7775e55f310940bd343b3972e5f571c4d294b0d4ebc173db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76497821715867d1d08c3a63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有一天，我会抵达水平线的彼端……",
      "source_fingerprint": "de41a17361ea769016d631e5b4d58e68b76a94fe707e561c8350629e87af1370",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d02f5ea3504254729ee1920",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听得见风声。\r\n真舒服……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a85d11c803827283780ed29c4451a11c64abdb4ae7510bf3c4018cd3f6c4324",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2df76fbcef5831f0129a3c6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我得把凉鞋的带子扣好才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9cfffeae62530ac1d367b2b80cbe85ecbc6647cfcb3c38208f0175dc67e40b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a991da0a4bc9ac49b475ad8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃……有什么令你在意的地方吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f29396104eaa94f88a6b8b2d40776332811e96622fdf31517b128344ef1a390a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efdddbbe66b3c22baccc5d0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔找个地方放松一下……\r\n或许也是个不错的选择呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f713ff2ee1cd062d4ab75f1d071d22b58c07f468ae29252245d70a38d34f8195",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c52daec46808d4ad2f7afdf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "往后我也想继续和你\r\n一起去看许许多多的景色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb1ef738b08c6c0d1642957352faa4f10262dbcc0ab4bf9a6d7b1ad27cc046dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d3f8eb1fed5c9a57b78a629",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看见了……独自一人一定无法企及的景色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "317b01b81e809f48ef777a408e33de0e7a79941552e7f40e21b5573e3c6a2a24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e566cdd08c9363508415242e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "托您的福，比我预想中成长得更快呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c3b568fccfdf5aa16d3d4bb17a40f1fc58aedb174a68ad97bb79092f219deba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a99d362c33ae9b80e930f47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是一幅如梦般的景色……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "271c0bd17ef144f7e2b8436a5df03c2009649b17b1193d27b845a67d935b3a79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfc975400f00309a74c94f9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会忘记……这段鲜明的回忆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0a7433ad2947b989798872569b334ec6201c5a5e7361a73162942db7ec4b9a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13e231d46863593906e3b370",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再快一些……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00aa38764d31c0e1b378f205823a359efbf9af2fdcbf7c2d7e480dfcbcc1c384",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47c54d452f02636d3f47cac4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "继续向前……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94e5edc1d43344961b15c3963b93949cbc9568155f21d264e7cb9ef8ed3bee2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:988b5174a933d5759747d927",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，是无声铃鹿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab24681d337eb2538bb18a11284c8e863631560233fc9ad21fa9e7d85e312ae0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db0af36b9e1f5d934eefbc12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前方的更前方……\n向着无人目睹的绝景……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15313edaeac105f22bf9136b12d56590ae0ae13b591f115189c133bf03c92411",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0188bceaee9bd29baffa8ff2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉能做到的事情变多了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8610551654985a501ead3999a7eee9d9a8289a1b8b401d3f9bdfcbadc16f152b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7a7d189f0fe853ee0c2685c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辅助的诀窍，我已经明白了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfc2239a5e3a60150cabbc2a10e1d5bfe5f78040d49077f5aa59cf30a09429bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43d557c84a9f33e5fbc51a1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既湛蓝，又深邃……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa9a2ecabac1ecdccd5b07dcbe2cd41acc1f629d9c95a720d0de0c7a514141cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06f53e8f6a984399ce43097a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直到汪洋的尽头……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dc77b9a7cfc2d258378c9f24625748aa5706fa0e1ed113b2a9233ff8eace267",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2e985b5cd5430e861866ea2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "依循着风的呼唤──\r\n直奔蔚蓝大海的彼端……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93716b39ce8338f1c27714a757239176eb09fcd67abcafa39465703e98a9c979",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94f75ebf3570c74a38b0d582",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是无声铃鹿。\r\n要不要到海的另一端……去看看呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fe1a1a6be13f694489c09c2fdafa1314ff943351c11a9c0e2c6ab8d77c6a373",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1088838b27741a61dd27e4c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会赢的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a844393e501319440e2d1cb2c9db2bed92003382707539d348a8b6940ce09696",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e60ec7a15779e92623cd2e29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说起来，会长虽然是非常厉害的\r\n赛马娘……但我们两个人一起的话\r\n一定能超越。超越给大家看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bc7fad6c6c3a472bbe343b016de0c02fce35a87f83eea3f6acc33966f53609d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf0c462ff8d5ab978dc89736",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるねー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5909d5966d662bbeeadf02b80069857c1ac6c00936ee685cba354c7b7710c43a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7423b91b917c9e0c1cbc65be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c76249a685fb9f9750702a9bec77a0f48bf5677e31f292201a7e3458e4d45b92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c912e6fd0056a526f183b4bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那时候一起完成的宣战布告……\r\n我们两个人、一定能实现！\r\n绝对，绝——对！约好了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5e067918f904cf15fff2b820da2def5fe9a25192960722195c0df8dfe477538",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21537dc27c77c2636bed8ff6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不论是游戏还是比赛……\r\n有训练员应援的话，就能努力加油！\r\n——这样想着。真的像魔法一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2e2e0a340a10d9e6ed98f701996dd642dee308af78d433c1c9493c3e8f1c871",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b7c89c25f38a0ebbf019b23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐，和我一起拍羽毛毽嘛！\r\n要是输了的话就在脸上涂鸦，\r\n做好被涂得乌黑的准备吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f745abb68cb8916410104450f6409a353abfeead1991f76ebd0075da694dd3df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cf4dfe71cfced2e9382a410",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～，情人节真是绝妙啊！\r\n我呢，似乎暂时不愁吃些甜点呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5cdd36c7237c3f9b656b1f167ecf88196a33308da739a3592fecc53bd3251bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c7545e1ffd3155ea3d8eaf4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐，呐，训练员。\r\n想要我的巧克力？想要的对吧～？\r\n没办法呢，来！请——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "994f1c541012a1ef42f97b89f566486478040f2779a3abbfd09805d83af376d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb7b0f31cd07275e8366dd62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "牵牛星，要是轻——轻一跃\r\n就能跳过银河就好了啊。\r\n为什么不跳呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e2a2edf03bf1e6b2b1179258d4a67cd9aa852f1e67e9e037d33906fdd282b70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:821d7a1711d66a44f0c51d0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不给糖就捣蛋！\r\n来吧，各位！\r\n把糖果交给我吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c564406ca098f82881738353ea604dccfce9c63f932aa35677a24242e6a418c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea4da4416ee47f7a4f08fe45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞树的装饰，绝——对要让我来\r\n把顶端的星星装上去～！\r\n因为目标是第一嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f10e7d16fcc5c4ec3fbbc688da0ed6757a27b328f3bf22fd1ade385cbdffe3d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9d0f0813d17e53abae2c88f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好不容易迎来了圣诞节，一起玩嘛！\r\n吃蛋糕、玩游戏……\r\n今晚可会相当忙碌哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b3d7a1b29dc43c45c50e54208b60a832128a65ac82c5cd5571dd3e7b0d8057d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f7d96c5aa257feb3c7c979d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～哼！理所当然的结果呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1068fb131ffab10720c0299a361be4f4f51b08810bdae62b76aeb6bd7f0c9d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dc652dd169d8fb572a113e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跨年的瞬间跳起来的话，\r\n就能“不在地球上”跨年啦！\r\n我和重炮一起做了哟～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef2fb382ec84ad8aa648e5c7b09fff43fbb8c6b95d56671ad53810da1ae45790",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41674176d6a13586ebb6a259",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，是生日对吧？\r\n真好啊～。是今天的主角呢。\r\n我也想全力庆祝呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2132807a1f8d56666a6846d1557f7eab69496437b19b0902d6b86031c0f5584a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1006e60e1b38e78318249cfd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了训练员，我超——级用心地\r\n准备了这个大蛋糕！\r\n所以分给我一半吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e84fd249980c2fc087e8037c2af8b63ebc32c6a93f32b6d1c9972791548643a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfd749c21c41deae0c8d5dc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼～哼～哼～。\r\n实话实说吧，今天可是我的生日！\r\n来吧来吧，要盛大地庆祝才足够哟～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "23a43cb9e0c4ba4b47fba0a1a6c020786b8f2515c5e21a38534464f1caee9f3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:253fb51cb7c391fe4dbce563",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到训练员的礼物，\r\n从昨天开始就一直很高兴！\r\n我的这份快乐，你是最理解的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "15bc2cb782ec419275c568af207a9b33559de5e6e3e8b859348f5238684d6b81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd8ebd1a07ed63b38f880549",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有通知消息！\r\n是什么呢～好在意啊～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b705240ce44ad339936d5092ee48a9c3122021905134ea621e65554ac067d043",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94c09cfcb274acafca4bf7fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎有礼物送到了呢？\r\n呐呐，之后让我也看看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d582a5c3b768eb9f2e2566289c583f6c4cab7cba7cbf30e7c13812a8a9f9ccd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2224a2fcae1200496da3940b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成～！\r\n哼哼，不愧是我们呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a552314e26facc244c9d862b480b7fb650fa166c678c96c4dfd749bd4b7f4f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6005ffb41a954b23a323bb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像很快就有活动了！\r\n会长应该也会参加吧～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa991dc42e4970ab97b15946eba18987736cb2485cd8f6c59137a2a27203a04d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:261ac7ce3ea08b32d457cc76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐呐！是活动哦！\r\n赶紧出发吧～！\r\n我啊，相当乐在其中呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e59f2df537cd5d5ef3bd9f4696b55226a08eb40ee69d41e5f3c2fff858640be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42730143b02ec7cfd92bb780",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我居然输了什么的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0ad203e9b87486da60eaa52cdc521890c8dfcfc02bcb250fcab397fc2e768c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4acffb49ab1710546064a02e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐呐，赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n似乎提升了哟？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1ea770f5256a85d0a60a0b9a8b9b1bc763a38cd2b61117211dba2ce13d359c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d4023779c97c9672fcaf115",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服是我用零用钱买的喔～?\r\n怎么样？穿起来方便活动，\r\n颜色又很有活力，很棒吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0161a59898a35d927da79ac78aa897dd0578950ee25337cf46e40d1eabd1712d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d0a855fb14abcbfb5d9f6ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "会长带我跟小鹤去了\r\n她常去的咖啡厅喔。\r\n那家店真是时髦呢～?",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dbf2387d6e128156c5346109f59560e4514eca4d24e8759eab9a16aec477c7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e4b767d1a2c43fdb39e4d12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要去哪？游戏厅？卡拉OK？\r\n一起喝杯蜂蜜特饮？只要有我在，\r\n不管去哪里都会好玩啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b7c11223b7ad933550aaa25c57514ece0ffaa6ddc21abccecf527d943e13629",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e548b13a089dc64414c35703",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿、白热化了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "460d02701d5a94825facda997deac4fd3511e24141a216dcb1d9a1f0297399ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d329aef5d830e6307ab64ab4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是我们的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59eb6aef37d792786c433c4cd4e9a568dd89828fee548a2118a9f20e96d22b81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a19c12b783695d50fafd6f88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我居然输了什么的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0ad203e9b87486da60eaa52cdc521890c8dfcfc02bcb250fcab397fc2e768c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0ec432a64fec003758f2f41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿、白热化了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "460d02701d5a94825facda997deac4fd3511e24141a216dcb1d9a1f0297399ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc8cd2ff08881abba7bccf14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了！最高分更新～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36c3184bbcd411cf9921b03ee3cff905b7ccf9df788b5a9f4134914afb48e5af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f072ad6af4344cebedc56e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家、鼓起劲地上了哦——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92faa69de31812bd3ff893fff63f29f01c0a3ab8470f8c433047933075118951",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3fd66652b7397a212a50833",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和会长一起诶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7f803a5f984b5a358a48fe757b5be25e17f24d7c33e1adea8422184073f9b06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "1013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:407fc7a275e8b48bd5485863",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "摩耶、上了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6c0f4c0b90496e180c0f5b84ffa2ccaec967f9d24201bba3b6cac67fbfcd787",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "1014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57de6e2c48de0ac9286f9e36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用担心♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "eca194e9c808f325f15f1a47186c6438f78670ceb43cadd871cace1956ed0604",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "1043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:707c804d1d446b910422049b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:764bcef0c5cd92c7fdeb22c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那就赶紧开始训练吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "199f8d01ec2a51a7512e97ea13b4b5d68c51b910f51f7528194bd72bd477fd97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfb1a101784d193b8037715f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯，\r\n在意的话有很多呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c70f787bf50f7e08ff0b76fea5421b5c8612fbb1923301dbc636b0a34f5bb7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f8a633d58582d9d6db410ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，是来\r\n给比赛报名的吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5494e1e7debe8a2712e794aa46579980e4a70aa747c24afd303666a33b422a87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
